// Conformance fixture for ta.stoch (S-bead OpenBBTechnical-0e9.5.24, Wave 5B-2).
//
// Author-derivative posture per PRD §7.3: reference output computed
// deterministically by running this script's Stochastic formula against a
// hard-coded synthetic (close, high, low) series (see ta_stoch.csv). No
// chart data is redistributed; the .csv is a pure function of this .pine.
//
// ta.stoch returns only the fast %K component:
//   k = 100 * (close - lowest(low, length)) / (highest(high, length) - lowest(low, length))
// clamped to [0, 100]. The %D signal line is a separate ta.sma(k, 3) that
// this fixture intentionally does NOT emit — Wave 5B-2 owns the %K primitive.
//
// Warm-up: k = NA until bar (length - 1) — i.e. NA on bars 0..3, first value at bar 4.
//@version=6
indicator("smoke_ta_stoch", overlay=false)
plot(ta.stoch(close, high, low, 5), title="stoch5")
